### 消息模块 (ani-chat) API 测试

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9096
@token = your_auth_token_here

### 1. 会话管理 (Conversation)

#### 1.1 获取当前用户的会话列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/conversation/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

---

#### 1.2 创建或进入私聊会话
# targetUserId: 对方用户的 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversation/private?targetUserId=467bd41e-f175-466c-8eb8-791857353011
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

---

#### 1.3 创建群聊会话
# title: 群名称
# Body: 成员 ID 列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/conversation/group?title=动漫爱好者群
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "467bd41e-f175-466c-8eb8-791857353011",
  "MjM3MzNiMTUtNDJiYi00Mm"
]

---

### 2. 消息管理 (Message)

#### 2.1 发送消息
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "your_conversation_id_here",
  "type": "text",
  "content": "你好，这是测试消息！",
  "attachment": null
}

---

#### 2.2 获取会话历史消息
# conversationId: 会话 ID
# lastMessageId: 可选，最后一条消息 ID (分页)
# pageSize: 可选，默认 20
GET {{baseUrl}}/message/history?conversationId=your_conversation_id_here&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

---

#### 2.3 撤回消息
# messageId: 消息 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/recall/your_message_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

---

#### 2.4 标记单条消息为已读
# messageId: 消息 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/read/your_message_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

---

#### 2.5 标记整个会话为已读
# conversationId: 会话 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/read/conversation/your_conversation_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

---

#### 2.6 举报消息
# messageId: 消息 ID
# reason: 举报原因
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/report/your_message_id_here?reason=违规内容
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
